\par\par \b \uc2  Mexico's Ortiz: April Inflation Likely Below 0.6% \b0\par\par\uc2 213 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 5 Mai 2000\par 18:18\par \uc2  Capital Markets Report \par \uc2 CM\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 2000, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  LONDON -(Dow Jones)- Mexico's inflation is expected to be below 0.6% in April and will allow the country to meet its 10% annual inflation target this year, Guillermo Ortiz, governor of the Mexican \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , told Dow Jones Newswires Friday. \par \par \uc2  Ortiz said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has an inflation target of 3% by 2003 but he couldn't reveal what the inflation targets for 2001 and 2002 would be. \par \par \uc2  "We are going to have a change in government and a lot will depend on who wins," Ortiz said. \par \par \uc2  Ortiz added that both presidential frontrunners, Vincente Fox of the National Action Party and Francisco Labastida of the Ruling Institutional Revolutionary Party, endorsed the target of 3% by 2003. \par \par \uc2  Ortiz said the government's overall fiscal position had worked well alongside the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's monetary policy and was partly responsible for bringing annual inflation down from 50% in 1995. \par \par \uc2  Ortiz dismissed \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets to weaken the peso. "\b \highlight22\uc2 Mexico\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  hadn't \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  since 1998, during the worst moments of the Russian crisis," he said, adding that the bank would only \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  again in similarly dire circumstances. \par \par \uc2  -By Gonzalo Vina +44 171 842 9497 gonzalo.vina@dowjones.com \par \par \uc2 Dokument cm00000020010804dw5500a4z\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
