\par\par \b \uc2  Brazil's Fraga sees similarities with Mexico. \b0\par\par\uc2 235 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 4 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 1999\par 20:12\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1999 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  BRASILIA, March 4 (Reuters) - The new president of Brazil's \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said on Thursday that Brazil's floating \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  system and its plan to set inflation targets was similar to Mexico's strategy after the peso's devaluation in 1994. \par \par \uc2  "We are not adopting a regime identical to Mexico's, although some similarities exist given that Mexico also has inflation targets and a floating \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2 . The \b \highlight22\uc2 operational\b0 \highlight\uc2  details will be different, but the general principle is not very different," Fraga told a news conference. \par \par \uc2  He was answering a question from a reporter about whether Brazil would adopt \b \highlight22\uc2 Mexico\b0 \highlight\uc2 's system of automatic \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market whenever the peso falls or rises by more than 2 percent against the dollar. \par \par \uc2  Fraga said earlier that the Brazilian \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  would \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets when necessary and the \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  would "discrete and limited." \par \par \uc2  He also said Brazil would use overseas borrowing to help provide local \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets with liquidity. \par \par \uc2  While private markets remain closed to Brazil as it scrambles to recover from a 40 percent-plus devaluation, a second instalment of loans from the International Monetary Fund, currently under discussion in Washington, would also be used partly to fund the country's balance of payments deficit, he said. \par \par \uc2  ((Brasilia newsroom 5561 314 1193; brasilia.newsroom@reuters.com)). \par \par \uc2  (C) Reuters Limited 1999. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010908dv34022n4\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
