\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Mexico \highlight\uc2  Peso Opens -2:  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\uc2  Concerns Loom \b0\par\par\uc2 260 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 8 Oktober 1998\par 16:55\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1998, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 MEXICO\b0 \highlight\uc2  CITY (Dow Jones)--\b \highlight22\uc2 Mexico\b0 \highlight\uc2 's peso opened sharply weaker against the dollar Thursday as a wider-than-expected trade deficit for August compounded worries about global financial turmoil. \par \par \uc2  The Bank of Mexico auctioned $200 million at about 1400 GMT at an average rate of 10.3914 pesos to the dollar, with bids ranging from 10.3875 and 10.4000, traders said. The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  sells up to $200 million a day whenever the peso weakens 2.0% against the dollar from the previous day's fix. \par \par \uc2  In Mexico City around 1440 GMT, on 48-hour spot dollar markets, Banamex quoted the peso trading at a mid rate of 10.3900 to the dollar against 10.2350 at Wednesday's close. Spreads were 10.3800/10.4000, compared with 10.2200/10.2500 Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  Banamex quoted the spot peso opening at a mid rate of 10.4100 to the dollar. \par \par \uc2  Other banks had the spot dollar trading at spreads ranging from 10.3900/10.4100 pesos to 10.3950/10.4150. \par \par \uc2  "It's considerably ugly, extremely volatile," said a trader at a Mexican bank. \par \par \uc2  The peso is likely to trade between 10.3500 and 10.4500 to the dollar, protected on the downside by speculation that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  further to bolster the Mexican \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the trader said. \par \par \uc2  "The Bank of Mexico no longer respects the free float," the trader said. "We have a dirty float, which puts everyone on guard." \par \par \uc2  (MORE) Dow Jones Newswires 08-10-98 \par \par \uc2  1455GMT \par \par \uc2  1027 1852 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010920dua8004sr\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
