\par\par \b \uc2  Bank Of Mexico/Dollars -4: To Issue Press Release Later \b0\par\par\uc2 260 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 10 September 1998\par 21:56\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1998, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  As reported earlier Thursday, the Bank of Mexico also extended its shortfall to the money market to a daily 100 million pesos from 70 million pesos. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  official said the peso came under intense pressure Thursday from weakness in Brazilian and U.S. equities, which "directly transmits to our markets." \par \par \uc2  Brazil's Bovespa index was losing 15% at 1945 GMT on fears that the real could be devalued before presidential elections on Oct. 4. The Dow Jones Industrial Average, meanwhile, was off 3.7%. \par \par \uc2  The Mexican stock exchange's key IPC index was losing 9.9%, or 312.60 points, to 2854.66 points. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  official said the volatility and nervousness in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market caused the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to take a series of actions to provide support to the peso. \par \par \uc2  "\b \highlight22\uc2 Interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  (in the market) are more efficient and have more success if they are accompanied by other measures," the official said. "We want to send the message that in light of these external problems, we are acting quickly and opportunely." \par \par \uc2  While not ruling out further \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  if volatility continues, he said the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Mexico\b0 \highlight\uc2  "reserves the use of this instrument for conditions of real emergency." \par \par \uc2  The peso closed Thursday at a mid rate of 10.6000 per dollar. \par \par \uc2  The Bank of Mexico is expected to issue a press release later Thursday detailing the measures taken and the amount of dollars it used to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 10-09-98 \par \par \uc2  1956GMT \par \par \uc2  1027 1852 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010916du9a07tb3\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
