\par\par \b \uc2  Bank Of Mexico/Dollar -2: Up To 3 Auctions A Day \b0\par\par\uc2 286 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 27 August 1998\par 15:31\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1998, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  MEXICO CITY (Dow Jones)--The Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Mexico\b0 \highlight\uc2  has altered the mechanism for \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market in support of the peso, although it maintains the daily limit of $200 million, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said. \par \par \uc2  In a press release late Wednesday, the bank said that instead of a single auction of $200 million when the spot peso-dollar rate moves 2.0% above the previous day's fix, the bank will hold up to three auctions in a given session. \par \par \uc2  The $200 million auctions were instituted in February 1997. Under the original plan, the bank held the auction between 1 p.m. and 1:15 p.m. local time (1800-1815 GMT), selling dollars at a minimum of 2.0% above the previous day's fix, which is set by the bank the previous day based on a sample of spot rates. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said the Exchange Commission decided to allow up to three auctions a day, from 9 to 9:15 a.m., from 11 to 11:15 a.m. and 1 to 1:15 p.m. The amount of dollars to be auctioned will remain at $200 million, with subsequent auctions offering only dollars unsold at the earlier auctions. \par \par \uc2  If auctions are held on successive days, the minimum sale rate is 2.0% above the previous day's minimum auction price. \par \par \uc2  The Bank of Mexico placed $200 million at an auction Wednesday, as the peso continued to feel pressure from Russia's financial crisis and the plunging ruble. The peso closed Wednesday at 9.7550 per dollar on 48-hour spot markets. \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 27-08-98 \par \par \uc2  1331GMT \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010916du8r07arp\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
