\par\par \b \uc2  Mexican Peso Ends -3: Pressures Outweigh Central Bk Actions \b0\par\par\uc2 287 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 20 August 1998\par 21:26\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1998, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  Traders said local investors fear a \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  crisis in Venezuela could hamper the country's commitments to reduce its crude exports in a joint multinational effort aimed at boosting sagging world oil prices. \par \par \uc2  Other global factors behind a potential devaluation of the bolivar create a knock-on effect on Mexico's floating peso as investors turn cautious on emerging markets' assets, traders added. \par \par \uc2  The peso has failed to strengthen despite an array of efforts from the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 . On Wednesday, the Bank of Mexico reinforced its restrictive monetary policy by imposing limits on the daily interbank lending. \par \par \uc2  In addition, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has four times this year - twice in the past two weeks alone - expanded its daily "short" to the banking system as a means to reduce liquidity. The "short" currently stands at MXN70.0 million. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  also has instituted a mechanism of dollar options to counter exchange volatility. \par \par \uc2  When the peso moves by more than 2.0% against the dollar from a fixed level set the previous day by the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  based on a sample of spot rates, the Bank of Mexico auctions $200 million in dollar options to commercial banks. \par \par \uc2  The peso weakened by 1.4% Wednesday to its weakest level since it was released from its trading band in December 1994. \par \par \uc2  The Bank of Mexico set Thursday's "fix" at 9.3134 per dollar. A \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  official who spoke on condition of anonymity said the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Mexico\b0 \highlight\uc2  "didn't \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market in any way" to strengthen the peso Thursday. \par \par \uc2  -By Santiago Perez and Elliot Spagat; 525 726 9153 \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 20-08-98 \par \par \uc2  1926GMT \par \par \uc2  1027 1852 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010916du8k073y6\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
