\par\par \b \uc2  Banco de  \highlight22\uc2 Mexico \highlight\uc2  says no  \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\uc2  in peso mkt. \b0\par\par\uc2 264 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 27 Februar 1997\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1997 Reuters Limited\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 MEXICO\b0 \highlight\uc2  CITY, Feb 27 (Reuter) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Mexico\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said Thursday it did not \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the country's \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market to support the peso, which was badly hit during the day by economic and political concerns. \par \par \uc2  A Banco de Mexico spokeswoman said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  only sells dollar put options to local banks until 1215 p.m. local/1815 GMT, slightly more than an hour before the market closes. \par \par \uc2  "Since the peso was not more than 2 percent weaker at that time, the Banco de \b \highlight22\uc2 Mexico\b0 \highlight\uc2  did not \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2 ," said the spokeswoman, who wished to remain anonymous. \par \par \uc2  The peso ended down 17.6 centavos in key 48-hour contracts at 7.96/7.98 per dollar -- more than two percent lower on the day. \par \par \uc2  Banco de Mexico recently unveiled a plan to build reserves and dampen exchange rate volatility, promising to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  market with up to $200 million if the peso falls more than two percent in a given day. \par \par \uc2  "In case the (dollar) exchange rate rises on a given day by more than two percent from the exchange rate of the previous working day, $200 million will be auctioned among banks with a minimum price two percent above (the exchange rate) on the prior working day," Banco de Mexico said at the time in a statement. \par \par \uc2  The spokeswoman was unable to say if the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  would sell dollars at the start of trade on Friday. \par \par \uc2  ((--David Luhnow, Mexico City newsroom +525 728-9565)) \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1997 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020011002dt2r09cyh\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
