\par\par \b \uc2  No risk of Mexico devaluation - business leader. \b0\par\par\uc2 222 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 2 Oktober 1996\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1996 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  MEXICO CITY, Oct 2 (Reuter) - The head of Mexico's top business group Hector Larios Santillan ruled out Wednesday any risk of a new devaluation in Mexico. \par \par \uc2  "No, absolutely not", he told reporters. "Here what we need to be watching is solely and exclusively that our \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  has the balance and the competitivity which is needed so that (other countries') products don't end up being cheaper abroad than what we are exporting." \par \par \uc2  Larios, president of the Business Coordinating Council, was speaking after Massachusetts Institute of Technology economics guru Rudiger Dornbusch caused a stir here by saying that Mexico did not have a truly free-floating peso because Banco de \b \highlight22\uc2 Mexico\b0 \highlight\uc2  was \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  to stop it from moving. \par \par \uc2  Larios said business leaders were sure that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  was not \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2 .  "I repeat, what we need to is to ensure that our \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  is competitive. The president himself has committed himself to not letting our \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  overvalue and this is very important," he said. \par \par \uc2  Larios said he believed predictions that the peso would be around eight to the dollar by the year end, a level which he said would "cover perfectly the undervaluation which is needed for the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  to be competitive." \par \par \uc2  -- Jacqueline Lerma, Mexico City newsroom +525 728 9701 \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1996 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020011018dsa2026xb\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
